[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Bulwark Lite is installed in %%WWWDIR%%.

Serve this directory at the root of a dedicated HTTPS virtual host.
The upstream release is built for /; hosting it under a subpath requires
a separate upstream build.

Set jmapServerUrl in %%WWWDIR%%/config.json and configure Stalwart
to allow requests from your webmail origin (CORS). config.json and
policy.json are preserved across package upgrades. They are public
browser configuration; do not put passwords or other secrets in them.

Web-server examples, including deep-link routing and security headers:
  %%EXAMPLESDIR%%/nginx.conf
  %%EXAMPLESDIR%%/Caddyfile
Review and adapt an example to your HTTPS virtual host; neither is enabled
automatically. Ensure .mjs files are served as JavaScript.

Deployment details: %%DOCSDIR%%/LITE-README.md
The matching upstream source archive is also installed in %%DOCSDIR%%.

This is the static Lite edition. It has no Node.js service, admin console,
plugins, cross-device settings sync, or web push notifications.
EOM
}
]
